w_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-23T11:40:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-23T11:40:55Z","body":"> Please upload a minimal project to make sure all the steps match\n\nAdded 👍","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2746164061/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3063729429","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104513#issuecomment-3063729429","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104513","id":3063729429,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62nM0V","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T20:30:01Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T20:31:39Z","body":"I can confirm this is happening, but I have the suspicion it's undocumented but expected. The options to flip the tangent and binormal make me think it's assuming a fixed orientation for the heightmap, but I can't find anything that states that directly.\n\n> Godot v4.5.beta (d7cc121e6) - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti (nvidia; 570.133.07) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.28 GiB memory","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3063729429/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3064581300","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104513#issuecomment-3064581300","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104513","id":3064581300,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62qcy0","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-12T03:20:27Z","updated_at":"2025-07-12T03:20:27Z","body":"The script is missing code to generate tangents. You can either generate them yourself or you can use the `generate_tangents()` function to do it. \n\nThis script works:\n\n```\n@tool\nextends MeshInstance3D\n\n@export_range(0.0, 360.0, 0.1)\nvar rotate_uv = 0.0:\n\tget: return rotate_uv;\n\tset(value):\n\t\trotate_uv = value;\n\n@export_tool_button(\"Regenerate Mesh\")\nvar regenerate_mesh_button = func():\n\tregenerate_mesh();\n\nfunc regenerate_mesh():\n\tvar mesh_arrays := PlaneMesh.new().get_mesh_arrays();\n\n\tvar vertices := mesh_arrays[Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX] as PackedVector3Array;\n\tvar indices := mesh_arrays[Mesh.ARRAY_INDEX] as PackedInt32Array;\n\tvar normals := mesh_arrays[Mesh.ARRAY_NORMAL] as PackedVector3Array;\n\tvar uvs := mesh_arrays[Mesh.ARRAY_TEX_UV] as PackedVector2Array;\n\n\tvar surface_tool = SurfaceTool.new();\n\n\tsurface_tool.begin(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES);\n\n\tvar index := 0;\n\tfor vertex in vertices:\n\t\tsurface_tool.set_normal(normals[index]);\n\t\tvar uv = Transform2D.IDENTITY.rotated(deg_to_rad(rotate_uv)) * uvs[index];\n\t\tsurface_tool.set_uv(uv);\n\t\tsurface_tool.add_vertex(vertices[index]);\n\t\tindex += 1;\n\n\tfor i in range(indices.size()):\n\t\tsurface_tool.add_index(indices[i]);\n\n\t# Need to regenerate tangents after modifying UVs\n\tsurface_tool.generate_tangents()\n\tmesh = surface_tool.commit();\n```\n\nThis is the same as the script in the MRP with the addition of `surface_tool.generate_tangents()`.\n\nGodot generates tangents automatically on import. Tangents are based on UV and normals. So when you update your UVs, you need to update your tangents at the same time. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3064581300/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]